# Abandoned Air Temple: "This land enters tapped unless you control a basic land." Bot1's only other land is a Tundra
# (the Plains and Island types, but not basic, CR 205.4a) and Bot2 controls a Plains, which is not Bot1's to count: on
# turn 3 Bot1's Temple enters tapped. Bot2's own Temple on turn 4, beside its own Plains, enters untapped (the positive
# control: the same land, the same turn of the game, but a basic land it controls).

[Bot1 Deck]
Tundra
Abandoned Air Temple
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Abandoned Air Temple
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Tundra.Play
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Abandoned Air Temple.Play
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Abandoned Air Temple.Play

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Abandoned Air Temple.Tapped = true
Bot2.Battlefield.Abandoned Air Temple.Tapped = false
